Description: Exercise relative KillFilter policy with symlinked Rust cat
Forwarded: no

Set the actual executable directory on PATH only for the relative-path KillFilter fixture. Resolute cat resolves to /usr/lib/cargo/bin/coreutils/cat outside ambient PATH. Preserve all positive/negative signal and PATH assertions and leave production security policy unchanged.

